    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thousands Layered Blade: Reforged</strong> is an action-packed action RPG game that immerses players in a stunning <strong>3D</strong> world inspired by <strong>traditional sumi-e art</strong>, now enhanced with realistic <strong>brush stroke</strong> simulations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in the Far East Continent, a country is always in turmoil, where warlords and their hired samurai armies fight for power over the lands. One day, an Imperial Force led by an Emperor rises with a plan to unite them all under one flag. However, the leaders of the samurai, the 4 Kenseis - Sword Saints - foresee that this unification will cause the samurai to lose their way of the sword and their honor. Refusing to join the Imperials, they lead a rebellion against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where the journey of a young female assassin begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202310/extras/6020ab2c1f2ca7064feba21765bb46b3.poster.avif?t=1755479799\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202310/extras/6020ab2c1f2ca7064feba21765bb46b3.webm?t=1755479799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202310/extras/6020ab2c1f2ca7064feba21765bb46b3.mp4?t=1755479799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique ink-wash painting (sumi-e) styled 3D graphics, now with simulated brush strokes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block, parry, and dodge enemy attacks while waiting for the perfect moment to strike back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games to enjoy between battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience by defeating enemies and use it to unlock unique skills and special moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different katanas and equipment for each playthrough.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thousands Layered Blade: Reforged</strong> is an action-packed action RPG game that immerses players in a stunning <strong>3D</strong> world inspired by <strong>traditional sumi-e art</strong>, now enhanced with realistic <strong>brush stroke</strong> simulations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in the Far East Continent, a country is always in turmoil, where warlords and their hired samurai armies fight for power over the lands. One day, an Imperial Force led by an Emperor rises with a plan to unite them all under one flag. However, the leaders of the samurai, the 4 Kenseis - Sword Saints - foresee that this unification will cause the samurai to lose their way of the sword and their honor. Refusing to join the Imperials, they lead a rebellion against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where the journey of a young female assassin begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202310/extras/6020ab2c1f2ca7064feba21765bb46b3.poster.avif?t=1755479799\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202310/extras/6020ab2c1f2ca7064feba21765bb46b3.webm?t=1755479799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202310/extras/6020ab2c1f2ca7064feba21765bb46b3.mp4?t=1755479799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique ink-wash painting (sumi-e) styled 3D graphics, now with simulated brush strokes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block, parry, and dodge enemy attacks while waiting for the perfect moment to strike back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games to enjoy between battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience by defeating enemies and use it to unlock unique skills and special moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different katanas and equipment for each playthrough.</p></li></ul>",
